@page "/DefaultAdmin"

@*
    Default landing page for AppRole.Admin (LoginState.AdminLandingPath). Just a welcome screen -
    no cards, menus, statistics or other dashboard content.

    Admin reaches every page through PageAuthorization's role bypass, so it needs no designation and
    this route does not depend on one. It is NOT a PagePermission and appears in no RoleAccess.

    Independent of Pages/Welcome.razor (the "no designation assigned" screen) and of
    Pages/DefaultWelcome.razor (the non-Admin default). Nothing is shared between the three.

    No @layout is declared, so the router default (MainLayout) applies and the normal app shell
    provides navigation. Registered in PageGuard's _alwaysOpen set because it is the destination of
    LandingPage; without that it would be denied and redirected back to itself, looping forever.
*@

<div class="welcome-wrap">
    <div class="welcome-card">
        <div class="welcome-icon">👋</div>

        <h1 class="welcome-title">Welcome to SPIC ONE</h1>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .welcome-wrap {
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 24px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0a6b3d 0%, #1f3b2d 100%);
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .welcome-card {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 460px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
        border: 1px solid rgba(244, 216, 0, 0.35);
        border-radius: 18px;
        padding: 40px 32px;
        text-align: center;
        box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }

    .welcome-icon {
        font-size: 3rem;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .welcome-title {
        color: #1f3b2d;
        font-size: 1.6rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin: 0;
    }

    /* native: phone */
    @@media (max-width: 767.98px) {
        .welcome-wrap {
            min-height: 100dvh;
            padding: calc(16px + var(--safe-top, 0px)) 16px calc(16px + var(--safe-bottom, 0px));
            align-items: flex-start;
        }

        .welcome-card {
            max-width: none;
            padding: 28px 20px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            margin-top: 8vh;
        }

        .welcome-icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
        }

        .welcome-title {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
        }
    }
</style>
